# --- Datasets (large, and several are non-redistributable licenses --
# MAPLES-DR is CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0, EyePACS/APTOS have their own Kaggle terms.
# See training/README or each script's docstring for how to re-download.
# ~48GB as of writing -- the whole reason this .gitignore exists) ---
training/data/

# Cached intermediate tensors/logits -- regenerable from the model +
# datasets above, not source.
training/*_cache.npz
training/outputs/*.log
train.log
output.txt

# --- Secrets -- NEVER commit these ---
# The HMAC session-signing key (backend/auth.py auto-generates one on
# first run if absent; the file itself IS the secret).
backend/.secret_key
.env
.env.*

# --- Local runtime data ---
# SQLite screening history/operator accounts -- local instance state
# (contains password hashes + every prediction's base64 images), not
# project source. A fresh one is created automatically on first run.
backend/netra.db

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/

# --- Node / frontend build ---
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/

# --- MATLAB / Simulink build artifacts (regenerated by buildThroughputModel.m) ---
slprj/
*.slxc
*.asv

# Resumability checkpoints for long-running MATLAB batch scripts --
# regenerable by rerunning the script, not a final artifact (the trained
# classifier itself, e.g. maCandidateClassifier.mat, IS committed).
matlab/tests/*_checkpoint.mat

# importNetworkFromONNX auto-generates a MATLAB "+<network_name>" package
# of custom layer classes (e.g. ReduceMeanLayer*.m) for ONNX ops without a
# direct built-in layer equivalent, written to whatever the current folder
# is at import time -- codegen output, not hand-authored source, and
# regenerated automatically the next time predictGradeMATLAB.m /
# validateONNXAgainstPython.m imports the model.
matlab/**/+best_model/

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Editor/tooling local state (not project source) ---
.claude/
